          </p>

          <p>
            If your car does not have start-stop and lives a quiet life, the honest answer is that the EverStart Maxx or a similar flooded battery will do the job for less, and spending premium money on an AGM buys convenience rather than necessity. If your car has start-stop or came from the factory with AGM, cross the flooded options off the list entirely.
          </p>

